      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低电量模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Lumen %@ is available.\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Lumen %1$@ is available.\n\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen %1$@ 已发布。\n\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen adds the wallpaper to macOS's Aerial collection, under “Lumen”, and selects it for the Lock Screen and screen saver. It keeps playing even when Lumen isn't running. Turning this off restores your previous choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 会把壁纸加入 macOS 的航拍壁纸（归在“Lumen”分组下），并选为锁屏和屏幕保护程序。即使 Lumen 没有运行也会继续播放。关闭后会恢复你之前的选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen could not allocate the scene’s render targets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 无法为场景分配渲染目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen could not read the update information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 无法读取更新信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen couldn't access its Steam sign-in in Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 无法读取钥匙串中的 Steam 登录信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen finds Steam's Wallpaper Engine downloads and other apps' libraries automatically. Adding a wallpaper copies it into Lumen's library; on the same disk the copy takes no extra space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 会自动找到 Steam 下载的 Wallpaper Engine 内容和其他应用的壁纸库。添加时会复制到 Lumen 的资源库；在同一块磁盘上，复制不额外占用空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen is up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen looks in Steam's Wallpaper Engine Workshop folder and other apps' libraries. You can also add a folder of projects, for example one copied from a Windows PC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 会查找 Steam 的 Wallpaper Engine 创意工坊文件夹和其他应用的壁纸库。你也可以添加一个项目文件夹，比如从 Windows 电脑上拷过来的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen stops decoding whenever nobody can see the wallpaper — and when your Mac needs the energy more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人看得到壁纸、或者 Mac 更需要电量时，Lumen 会自动停止解码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen Update Available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumen 有新版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen's copy of this wallpaper is removed. The original file you imported is not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除 Lumen 里的副本，你最初导入的原文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac is asleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已睡眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can't play this %@ file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 无法播放这个 %@ 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can't play this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 无法播放这个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS shows the system wallpaper during Mission Control, Space switches and on the lock screen. Lumen sets it to a frame of your live wallpaper so those moments match, and restores your original picture when you stop using a wallpaper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 在调度中心、切换桌面空间和锁屏时会显示系统壁纸。Lumen 会把它设为当前动态壁纸的一帧，让这些画面保持一致；停用壁纸时会恢复你原来的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it lighter to play": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
