            "value": "场景用到的着色器和特效随 Wallpaper Engine 本体提供，不包含在各个创意工坊项目里。请在“设置 › Wallpaper Engine”中为 Lumen 指定 assets 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scenes use shaders, materials and effects that ship with Wallpaper Engine itself. Choose the “assets” folder of a Wallpaper Engine installation you own (for example copied from a Windows PC), or one another app downloaded. Lumen only reads it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
