    "Spectrum bars, pulsing effects and beat-driven particles listen to what your Mac is playing. macOS asks once for permission to record system audio. Lumen only measures loudness per frequency, in memory, and listens only while such a wallpaper is on screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "频谱条、脉动效果和随节拍跳动的粒子会跟着 Mac 正在播放的声音变化。macOS 会询问一次录制系统音频的权限。Lumen 只在内存中测量各频段的响度，并且只在这类壁纸显示时才监听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
